# SKU Naming and Labelling

## Short Description
SKU Naming and Labelling is the process of giving each store item a clear and unique code or label for easy identification.

## Purpose
It helps storekeepers quickly recognise products and avoid mixing up similar items.

## Main Functions/Activities
- Create a unique SKU for each item.
- Label products with their SKU.
- Include useful details such as product type, size, or colour where necessary.
- Use the SKU to find and identify items easily.
- Update the label when important product details change.
